CRITICAL fixes:
- aegis_console.py: Complete rewrite (file was corrupted with duplicate/interleaved functions)
- test_e2e.py: Resolve merge conflict (rule_id=56 integer for c_uint32)
- bridge/aegis_bridge_ctypes.py: Resolve merge conflict (type coercion for rule_id)
- bridge/aegis_ipc.cpp: Resolve merge conflict (auto-DEFCON update after push)
- pipe_monitor.zig: Resolve 6 merge conflicts (whitespace-only)
- windows_capture.zig: Remove duplicate code block (lines 79-118)

HIGH fixes:
- nids_analyze.zig: Add PacketContext + WfpEventHeader structs, add inspect_packet_ctx()
- nids_capture.zig: Use inspect_packet_ctx() instead of mismatched inspect_packet()
- windows_capture.zig: Use inspect_packet_ctx() for PacketContext calls
- aegis_dashboard/src/bridge_ffi.rs: Fix IpcEvent field sizes (c_ushort/c_uchar to match C++)
- bridge/aegis_bridge_ffi.rs: Same IpcEvent field size fix
- build.zig: Add Linux fallback library paths (build/ + bridge/)

MEDIUM:
- nids_capture.zig: Remove duplicate comment
- Python deps: networkx + pyvis installed
